        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Which of the following has the fewest number of 1s in its binary representation?\n\n$$\n9A7_{16}\\qquad B14_{16}\\qquad 7431_{8}\\qquad 4265_{8}\n$$",
        "zh": "将下列数字转化成二进制后,哪一个含有的1最少?\n\n$$\n9A7_{16}\\qquad B14_{16}\\qquad 7431_{8}\\qquad 4265_{8}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "9A7",
            "zh": "9A7"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "B14",
            "zh": "B14"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "7431",
            "zh": "7431"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "4265",
            "zh": "4265"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "more than 1 answer",
            "zh": "答案不止一个"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\n| Number | Binary | Number of 1s |\n|---|---|---|\n| $9A7_{16}$ | 100110100111 | 7 |\n| $B14_{16}$ | 101100010100 | 5 |\n| $7431_8$ | 111100011001 | 7 |\n| $4265_8$ | 100010110101 | 6 |\n\n$B14_{16}$ has the fewest 1s.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n把各位独立展开，再数 1。十六进制一位用四位二进制，八进制一位用三位。四个数 $9A7_{16}$、$B14_{16}$、$7431_8$、$4265_8$ 分别有 7、5、7、6 个 1，因此 $B14_{16}$ 最少。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "If this year is 84A in hexadecimal, what would the hexadecimal year be 3F7 hexadecimal years from now?",
        "zh": "若今年是 $84A_{16}$,那么从现在起 $3F7_{16}$ 年后以十六进制表示会是哪一年?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "C40",
            "zh": "C40"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "B31",
            "zh": "B31"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "D42",
            "zh": "D42"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "1241",
            "zh": "1241"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "C41",
            "zh": "C41"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Add the elapsed years in hexadecimal. Each column carries at 16.\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rccc}\n & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n & 8 & 4 & A \\\\\n+ & 3 & F & 7 \\\\\n\\hline\n & C & 4 & 1\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe units column gives $10+7=17$ in decimal, so write 1 and carry 1. The next column gives $4+15+1=20$, so write 4 and carry 1. The leftmost column gives $8+3+1=12$, written as C. The year is $C41_{16}$ (option E).",
        "zh": "把经过的年数按十六进制相加，每列满 16 向左进 1。\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rccc}\n & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n & 8 & 4 & A \\\\\n+ & 3 & F & 7 \\\\\n\\hline\n & C & 4 & 1\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n个位 $10+7=17$，写 1 进 1。下一列 $4+15+1=20$，写 4 进 1。最高列 $8+3+1=12$，写作 C。因此年份为 $C41_{16}$，选 E。"
      },
      "source": {
