    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Determine which of the following is the largest number:\n\n$$\n111001101010_{2}\\qquad E60_{16}\\qquad E69_{16}\\qquad 7147_{8}\\qquad 7150_{8}\n$$",
        "zh": "下列数字中最大的是哪个?\n\n$$\n111001101010_{2}\\qquad E60_{16}\\qquad E69_{16}\\qquad 7147_{8}\\qquad 7150_{8}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "111001101010",
            "zh": "111001101010"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "E60",
            "zh": "E60"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "E69",
            "zh": "E69"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "7147",
            "zh": "7147"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "7150",
            "zh": "7150"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\nTo find the largest, you must convert all of them to either base 8 or base 16:\n\n$$\n111001101010_{2}=E6A_{16}\n$$\n\n$E60_{16}$ and $E69_{16}$ are less than that. $7147_{8}$ is less than $7150_{8}$ which is 111 001 101 000 = 1110 0110 1000 which is $E68_{16}.$ It is also less than $E6A_{16}.$",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n统一成十六进制。二进制 `1110 0110 1010` 分组得到 $E6A_{16}$；八进制 $7147_8$ 展开为 `111 001 100 111`，重新分组得 $E67_{16}$。比较 $E60$、$E67$、$E69$ 和 $E6A$，只需比末位，A 的值 10 最大。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the base 10 equivalent to the most dominant (the one with the largest value) component in the hexadecimal color “#9FA0B1”?",
        "zh": "下列十进制的数中,哪一个和十六进制颜色“#9FA0B1”中最大的一部分(值最大)相等?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "193",
            "zh": "193"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "177",
            "zh": "177"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "176",
            "zh": "176"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "160",
            "zh": "160"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "159",
            "zh": "159"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nThe most dominant component in the hexadecimal color “#9FA0B1” is B1 which is the blue component. In base 10, B1 = 1 + B(11) * 16 = 1 + 176 = $177_{10}$ The RGB color using base 10 numbers (159,160,177) is Santa Grey.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n`#9FA0B1` 的红、绿、蓝分别是 `9F`、`A0`、`B1`。十六进制最高位依次为 9、10、11，故蓝色最大。$B1_{16}=11\\times16+1=177_{10}$。"
      },
